flowchart LR
    A[Eleven retained legacy categories<br/>actual immutable archive material] --> V[Credential-free archive assembler]
    R[Isolated restore evidence<br/>source = restored hashes and sizes] --> V
    S[Frozen recursive credential scan<br/>zero findings + externally pinned policy] --> V
    T[Annotated mt5-final evidence<br/>tag object resolves to source commit] --> V
    P[Retirement policy<br/>365-day remaining retention] --> V

    V --> G{Exact paths, bytes,<br/>lineage, reviews and timing?}
    G -- no --> X[Fail closed<br/>no archive manifest]
    G -- yes --> M[LegacyArchiveManifest v2<br/>manifest + bundle provenance]
    M --> I[Independent verify-archive replay]
    I --> F[Final-state assembly<br/>future increment]
    F --> Q[Retirement readiness]

    N[No broker, Git mutation, network,<br/>signer, stop or delete capability] -. security boundary .- V
